      "id": "claim_b3ad747616214717a8917e44fbba8c85",
      "statement": "Pixel Agents has two independently installed npm packages: the root package provides the server/build tooling and `webview-ui` provides the React/Vite application dependencies; root `dev` runs the server and Vite commands concurrently, while `build` runs both builds in sequence.",
